paration counters?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "We accept FED-X refrigeration enquiries for preparation counters, underbench cabinets and other commercial configurations. The precise model and fault determine service capability and the parts required. Send the identification details and describe which part of the cabinet is affected. We confirm the appropriate next step before committing to specialist work."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What does an error code on my commercial fridge mean?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "The meaning depends on the cabinet and its controller configuration. Some indications refer to operating conditions, while others identify faults that require further testing. Photograph the code and record the actual symptoms rather than changing service parameters. A technician can use the correct model information to interpret the warning accurately."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Is a refrigerant recharge the solution for a warm Polar or Skipio fridge?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Not necessarily. Inadequate cooling can result from closure, airflow, heat rejection, electrical controls or refrigeration circuit problems. Refrigerant loss must be investigated rather than assumed from cabinet temperature alone. A suitable technician determines whether sealed-system work is appropriate and whether a confirmed leak can be repaired safely and economically."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can I keep trading while a prep fridge is waiting for repair?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Trading arrangements depend on whether your business can maintain safe food handling and adequate alternative cold storage. Do not continue using a cabinet that cannot hold ingredients safely. Follow your food safety procedures, document affected stock and apply the appropriate time and temperature guidance. The responsible person must assess operational suitability."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can you attend on the same day if my commercial cabinet fails?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Same-day attendance may be available depending on location, scheduling and urgency. A prompt visit can establish the fault, but completion depends on suitable parts and safe access. Provide the model, temperature readings and any food safety impact when booking. Arrange alternative storage rather than relying on a guaranteed repair time."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you provide authorised warranty repairs for Polar, Skipio or FED?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Fridge Repairs Blacktown is an independent refrigeration repair business, not an authorised warranty representative for these brands. If the equipment is covered by its supplier or manufacturer, contact them before commissioning chargeable work. For other repairs, we assess the fault, explain the options and confirm our own applicable warranty terms."}}]}]}</script>", "_css_classes": "frbw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "ec5e131", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "html_tag": "div", "css_classes": "frb-global-styles frbc"}, "elements": [{"id": "3cac6c5", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "html_tag": "header", "css_classes": "frb-site-header frbc"}, "elements": [{"id": "78930d7", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "html_tag": "div", "css_classes": "frb-header-container frbc"}, "elements": [{"id": "48119a3", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"editor": "<div class="frb-logo">
